+        `install_engine_presets` added their rows, so the Formats group opened clipped. The
+        width below reserves the vertical scroll bar as well, so the options pane never needs
+        a horizontal scroll bar at the minimum width. Call this only after every
+        `register_format` of the constructor has run.
